  "ruleText": "PART Ac 305 CREDENTIALS: Ac 305.01 titled “License” and Ac 305.02 titled “Pocket Cards”\n\nThe prior filings for all of Ac 300 include the following documents:\n\n#1663, eff 12-17-80\n\n#1972, eff 2-28-82\n\n#2475, eff 9-13-83\n\n#3061, eff 7-18-85, EXPIRED: 7-18-91\n\n#4610, eff 5-10-89\n\n#5365, eff 3-27-92\n\n#5586, eff 2-22-93\n\n#5820, eff 5-3-94\n\n#6721, INTERIM, eff 3-27-98, EXPIRED: 7-25-98\n\n#6903, eff 12-4-98, EXPIRED: 12-4-06\n\n#8810, INTERIM, eff 1-25-07, EXPIRED: 7-25-07\n\n#9051, eff 12-27-07\n\n#10054, eff 1-1-12\n\n#10373, eff 7-2-13\n\n#10746, eff 1-1-15\n\n#12991, eff 2-21-20",
